  "details": "1. Be in holoport locomotion\n\n2. Load this world: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_8b064b1a-27e3-43c7-bb19-6c4cc57ad5ce\n\n3. Holoport into the pool; continue holding the joystick even after entering it.\n\n4. Your viewpoint will suddenly teleport into the pool even though you're still holding the joystick down (i.e. your viewpoint should still be where it was before you began holoporting)\n\n5. At this point, you can no longer open your menu to respawn or travel to another world.",
